Remove dublicate element in sorted way 

public static int removeDuplicates(int[] arr) {

    if (arr.length == 0) return 0;

    int j = 0;  // unique element pointer

    for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
        if (arr[i] != arr[j]) {
            j++;
            arr[j] = arr[i];
        }
    }

    return j + 1;   // new length
}
Logic
j holds position of last unique element
i scans array
Jab naya element milta hai → usko next position pe daal dete hain
Return length = 3
Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)

